    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "When the matter was taken up for hearing on 01.12.2025, there was no representation on behalf of the petitioner, thereby the matter was directed to be listed under the caption for dismissal on 02.12.2025.\n2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
