        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Even today (02.12.2025) when the matter is taken up for hearing, there is no representation on behalf of the petitioner, hence, this Civil Miscellaneous Petition stands dismissed for non prosecution even at the SR stage itself.",
